Error: Jet.DistinctTypeMismatch: A `U8` can't be used where a `Level` is expected
  --> Tests/UI/codec_impl_distinct_u8_fix.jet:6:21
    |
  6 |     level: Level{U8{1}}
    |                     ^
 Why: `Level` and `U8` are different types — even though `Level` is built on `U8`, one is never accepted in place of the other
 Fix: Convert explicitly: `Level.from_u8(expr)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.DistinctTypeMismatch
